- Added: Translations into 62 more languages: aka-GH, arc-IQ, asm-IN, aze-AZ, bel-BY, bho-IN, bod-CN, ceb-PH, che-RU,
  ckb-IQ, cym-GB, eng-AU, esl-MX, eus-ES, fil-PH, ful-SN, gla-GB, glg-ES, haw-US, huy-IL, hye-AM, ind-ID, jav-ID,
  kat-GE, kaz-KZ, khm-KH, kik-KE, kin-RW, kir-KG, lao-LA, lat-VA, lin-CD, ltz-LU, lug-UG, mai-IN, mkd-MK, mlg-MG,
  mon-MN, mri-NZ, msa-MY, mya-MM, nep-NP, orm-ET, pcm-NG, pnb-PK, run-BI, sin-LK, sna-ZW, snd-PK, sun-ID, syr-IQ,
  tat-RU, tgk-TJ, tha-TH, tir-ET, tlh-QO, tuk-TM, uig-CN, uzb-UZ, vie-VN, wol-SN and yid-US.
- Updated: The eng-US translation is complete.

Upgrading: composer update; clear the translation cache.
